# Keep source files LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# The test suite matches source code with regexes anchored on "\n". With CRLF
# in the working tree those regexes do not match, so the suite failed on
# Windows while passing on Linux CI. Measured 2026-10-24: 689 fast tests,
# first failure at step 56 (test/checkpoint-default-on.test.js could not find
# the function it was asserting existed).
#
# Fixing the checkout rather than editing 100 regexes keeps the assertions
# readable and makes the suite behave identically everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending translated.
*.png binary
*.wav binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
